y_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4618340-1846651706693545","game_id":"steam-4618340","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Chain Records & Sweep Memory","summary":"We've updated the demo. Steam will update it automatically (if the game is running, please restart it).Fixes- Fixed misaligned text in the Eternal Relic list.- Fixed the missing description for \"Graphics Quality\" in Settings.- Fixed CT Skills cast by relics sometimes not firing after resuming a fight.Changes- Clearing the field (\"SWEEP!\") now drops extra Memory.- The first launch now tells you when it is preparing the graphics.- Hovering over the Eternal Relic list now shows the relic's card.- C","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T03:21:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693545","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:33:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4618340-1846651706690406","game_id":"steam-4618340","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: First Clear Rewards & Eternal Relics","summary":"We've updated the demo. Steam will update it automatically (if the game is running, please restart it).Fixes- Added a safeguard against freezes that could occur on some older Intel integrated GPUs. On those PCs, Graphics Quality is set to Medium once, the first time the game starts after this update (you can change it back in Settings).Changes- First Clear rewards now come with their own presentation. Press \"Receive First Clear Rewards\" on the results screen to see your Eternal Relic, the newly ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:06:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690406","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:33:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id